      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a rest. it feels like the well is just... bone dry. like the part of me that actually mattered, the part that made life worth the effort, is just gone for good. it's like looking into a mirror and seeing a stranger. how do you keep going when there's nothing left inside to drive you?",
